      "path": "main.cpp",
      "text": "struct Widget {\n    int value;\n    Widget& operator=(const Widget& other);\n};\n\nvoid take(auto item) {}\n\nvoid forms(Widget a, Widget b) {\n    Widget* made = ::new Widget;\n    int Widget::*field = &Widget::value;\n    a = b;\n    ::delete made;\n}\n\ntemplate <class T>\nint call(T object) {\n    return object.template get<int>();\n}\n",
